          "title": "2020.1.5–1.10｜中央线通勤与城市观察",
          "html": "<figure><img src=\"/diary-media/diary-img-975eb943e7db2f47.webp\" width=\"1146\" height=\"1818\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"2020.1.5–1.10｜朋友圈截图\n\"/><figcaption>2020.1.5–1.10｜朋友圈截图\n</figcaption></figure><p><b>发生了什么：</b>在中央线通勤、电视节目和折纸灵感的小工具之间继续观察城市生活。</p>",
          "topics": [],
          "originalHeading": true
        },
        {
          "id": "d-2020-01-11",
          "date": "2020-01-11",
          "title": "2020.1.11–1.26｜压力、快递与选举新闻",
          "html": "<figure><img src=\"/diary-media/diary-img-50cfc7c9e3435d4b.webp\" width=\"1156\" height=\"1830\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"2020.1.11–1.26｜朋友圈截图\n\"/><figcaption>2020.1.11–1.26｜朋友圈截图\n</figcaption></figure><p><b>发生了什么：</b>在工作压力下买汤、等待深夜快递，也关注选举新闻与语言背后的意义。</p>",
          "topics": [],
          "originalHeading": true
        },
        {
          "id": "d-2020-02-01",
          "date": "2020-02-01",
          "title": "2020.2.1–2.14｜疫情物资报道与课堂作业",
          "html": "<figure><img src=\"/diary-media/diary-img-c77440157f08b1a5.webp\" width=\"1152\" height=\"1814\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"2020.2.1–2.14｜朋友圈截图\n\"/><figcaption>2020.2.1–2.14｜朋友圈截图\n</figcaption></figure><p><b>发生了什么：</b>关注武汉疫情物资报道，反复订正作业，在 Bob Dylan 和厨房小物里保留日常节奏。</p>",
          "topics": [],
          "originalHeading": true
        },
        {
          "id": "d-2020-02-14",
          "date": "2020-02-14",
          "title": "2020.2.14–3.25｜疫情扩散与《雪国》笔记",
          "html": "<figure><img src=\"/diary-media/diary-img-18ec24b7eeedcc27.webp\" width=\"1152\" height=\"1806\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"2020.2.14–3.25｜朋友圈截图\n\"/><figcaption>2020.2.14–3.25｜朋友圈截图\n</figcaption></figure><p><b>发生了什么：</b>关注全球疫情变化，在施工现场附近记下川端康成《雪国》的阅读笔记，并尽量外出透气。</p>",
          "topics": [],
          "originalHeading": true
        },
        {
          "id": "d-2020-03-26",
          "date": "2020-03-26",
          "title": "2020.3.26–5.5｜线上课程与语言里的笑点",
          "html": "<figure><img src=\"/diary-media/diary-img-baa9d6a91500437a.webp\" width=\"1156\" height=\"1838\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"2020.3.26–5.5｜朋友圈截图\n\"/><figcaption>2020.3.26–5.5｜朋友圈截图\n</figcaption></figure><p><b>发生了什么：</b>在疫情讨论、线上莎士比亚课程和春日天气中，继续阅读、学习语言，也捕捉日常里的笑点。</p>",
          "topics": [],
          "originalHeading": true
        },
        {
          "id": "d-2020-05-06",
          "date": "2020-05-06",
          "title": "2020.5.6–5.15｜梅雨、新闻与迎接夏天",
          "html": "<figure><img src=\"/diary-media/diary-img-b523163c49ecca16.webp\" width=\"1158\" height=\"1812\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"2020.5.6–5.15｜朋友圈截图\n\"/><figcaption>2020.5.6–5.15｜朋友圈截图\n</figcaption></figure><p><b>发生了什么：</b>经历梅雨天，观察新闻嘉宾的表达，用便利贴安排生活，并以喝茶的仪式迎接夏天。</p>",
          "topics": [],
          "originalHeading": true
        },
        {
          "id": "d-2020-05-15",
          "date": "2020-05-15",
          "title": "2020.5.15–6.11｜东京逐渐恢复日常",
          "html": "<figure><img src=\"/diary-media/diary-img-612b04802087fc34.webp\" width=\"1160\" height=\"1822\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"2020.5.15–6.11｜朋友圈截图\n\"/><figcaption>2020.5.15–6.11｜朋友圈截图\n</figcaption></figure><p><b>发生了什么：</b>东京生活逐渐恢复正常，在车站建筑、音乐、天妇罗与荞麦面中确认熟悉的城市节奏。</p>",
          "topics": [],
          "originalHeading": true
        },
        {
          "id": "d-2020-06-26",
          "date": "2020-06-26",
          "title": "2020.6.26–7.6｜口罩、疫情新闻与甜点减压",
          "html": "<figure><img src=\"/diary-media/diary-img-a0a3f102438bacc7.webp\" width=\"1162\" height=\"1816\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"2020.6.26–7.6｜朋友圈截图\n\"/><figcaption>2020.6.26–7.6｜朋友圈截图\n</figcaption></figure><p><b>发生了什么：</b>戴着口罩短暂休息，继续关注疫情新闻，也用甜点和蓝莓司康缓解压力。</p>",
          "topics": [],
          "originalHeading": true
        },
        {
          "id": "d-2020-07-16",
          "date": "2020-07-16",
          "title": "2020.7.16–9.1｜封锁期间的工作与晴天",
          "html": "<figure><img src=\"/diary-media/diary-img-3b353b934f4413ac.webp\" width=\"1156\" height=\"1830\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"2020.7.16–9.1｜朋友圈截图\n\"/><figcaption>2020.7.16–9.1｜朋友圈截图\n</figcaption></figure><p><b>发生了什么：</b>在封锁期间继续工作，逛手作市集、吃便当和年轮蛋糕，也珍惜天气放晴的片刻。</p>",
          "topics": [],
          "originalHeading": true
        },
        {
          "id": "d-2020-09-04",
          "date": "2020-09-04",
          "title": "2020.9.4–9.9｜四谷天空与完成感",
          "html": "<figure><img src=\"/diary-media/diary-img-d7be85f8ccb177ba.webp\" width=\"1164\" height=\"1826\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"2020.9.4–9.9｜朋友圈截图\n\"/><figcaption>2020.9.4–9.9｜朋友圈截图\n</figcaption></figure><p><b>发生了什么：</b>经过回收设施、街边树木和四谷站的天空，在一天结束时留下“完成得不错”的确认。</p>",
          "topics": [],
          "originalHeading": true
        },
        {
          "id": "d-2020-09-11",
          "date": "2020-09-11",
          "title": "2020.9.11–9.26｜四谷漫步与赫拉利阅读",
          "html": "<figure><img src=\"/diary-media/diary-img-c3fad0828d80baf9.webp\" width=\"1150\" height=\"1820\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"2020.9.11–9.26｜朋友圈截图\n\"/><figcaption>2020.9.11–9.26｜朋友圈截图\n</figcaption></figure><p><b>发生了什么：</b>在四谷一带散步，把普通街景看成旅行，也继续阅读赫拉利。</p>",
